AGY Quota (agy-quota)
Copyright 2026 AGY Quota Contributors

This project is an independent, 100% original Antigravity 2.x quota monitoring
suite (Top-Right Semi-Ring HUD, Zero-Copy Companion Overlay, Native Right
Auxiliary Sidecar, Cross-Platform Terminal CLI & Standalone Web Dashboard).

